<title>USA: Magnetic Technologies Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Magnetic Technologies Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended October 31,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> NET SALES			   $5,608,996	$6,825,012 (1)</p>
<p> NET INCOME				   244,863	    23,335</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE			    0.09		0.01</p>
<p> AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING	   2,875,424	 2,921,924</p>
<p>NOTES: Last year's first quarter results included sales of $1,012,749 and a loss of $248,693 from the company's former Austro Mold Group which was sold during the fourth quarter fiscal 1996.</p>
